    "message": "[CENTER][ATTACH]rb14_1[/ATTACH]\n\n[B][SIZE=6]Red Bull RB14[/SIZE][/B]\n[SIZE=4]The 2018 Red Bull Racing Formula 1 car: 1.6 L V6 turbo hybrid, 8-speed seamless gearbox, pushrod front / pullrod rear suspension and Red Bull's trademark high-rake aero platform.[/SIZE]\n\n[ATTACH]rb14_2[/ATTACH] [ATTACH]rb14_3[/ATTACH][/CENTER]\n\n[B][SIZE=5]Configurations[/SIZE][/B]\n[SIZE=4]- Low Downforce, Baseline, High Downforce, Aggressive\n- Adjustable front, rear and beam wing angles, springs, dampers, anti-roll bars, ride height, camber, caster\n- On-the-fly brake bias and pit limiter\n- Slicks and wets[/SIZE]\n\n[B][SIZE=5]Credits[/SIZE][/B]\n[SIZE=4]- Chassis and physics based on the Carbonworks F4 by LucasBE (the author's permission is needed before sharing this mod - see the project notes)\n- RB14 3D model: see the project notes for its source[/SIZE]",
